/* The application manifest of AgeOfCalamityRecomp.exe (AgeOfCalamityRecomp.manifest): resource 1 of type 24 (RT_MANIFEST), the one the loader reads
   for an executable, and the game icon (assets/icon.ico), which Explorer and SDL3 take as the first icon of the exe.
   tools/build.py compiles this with windres on Windows and links it with the runtime objects. */
1 24 "AgeOfCalamityRecomp.manifest"
1 ICON "icon.ico"
